cdk.out/
# CDK's context cache. Auto-generated by `cdk synth`, and it embeds the AWS
# account id in its lookup keys (e.g. availability-zones:account=...:region=...).
# This repo is public — keep it local.
cdk.context.json
*.js
!bin/*.ts
!lib/*.ts
# The CloudFront Function source (#289) is hand-written JS the CDK inlines,
# not compiled output — keep it tracked. Its testable twin (.mjs) is not
# matched by *.js, but list it here alongside for clarity.
!functions/*.js
!functions/*.mjs
